Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.34,0:01:56.22,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(650,0)\t(605,650,\1a&H00&)}Impasse
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.34,0:01:56.22,Title,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(650,0)}Impasse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, somebody go buy some more food!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've got the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get some more booze while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to painting,\NI'm in a league of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took all the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I face the others now, dummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, it's time to\Nkick their asses. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.98,0:02:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you lose this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losers get to go pick up more booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy all the food they\Nhave in the shop, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I am, I'm\Ngoing to win every hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are those guys? You jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you came to get your\Nmoney back, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think the four of\Nyou are enough to handle all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might as well take those big\Nbounties you've got on your heads
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the captain of that long-nosed\Nweakling we took care of earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that pitiful excuse for a pirate on\Nhis crew, he can't possibly be that strong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, come on, shrimp
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you punching him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a bombardment for battleship\Ncannons can put a den in that armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're just gonna play around, then\NI'll go ahead and end this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He punched a hole right through it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, fire the cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raven hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those cannonballs are made of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon's too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are seriously bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone run for the back door!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys started this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of pathetic to\Nrun from it like cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Party Table... Kick Course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't make it to the back door!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Windows! Use the windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A seal colonnade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just want the money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 200 million berries the\Nlong-nosed guy had, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to be the one to tell you, but\Nthat pile of money isn't here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, the family boss, took it\Nall and went on a shopping spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since he's buying\Nsomething on the black market,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't have any idea where he\Nmight be or even how to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no matter how much of a rampage you go\Non, that 200 million won't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DUMBAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even your bones will\Nbe left when we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even our bones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you\Nacting like a bunch of cowards?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the Franky family!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who do all the\Nbone-breaking around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never forget who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, brothers, let's show them\Nthe specialty of the Franky House!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, fire the Anything Shot Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come! Awesomeness! Pull it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep firing till there's\Nnothing left to shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only four of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's coming from\Nout toward the Franky house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What trouble are they up to this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quiet, they're gonna hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, sounds like they're\Ngetting a little carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When those boys party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really don't show any\Nrestraint, now do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like they do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we go after Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start looking. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like these idiots really\Ndidn't know where he took the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we do find him, if he spent\Nit, then there's no getting it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we wait around for him, he\Nmay not be back for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the first aid treatment is all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to take him back on a stretcher\Nso I can use some help over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanging around here won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head back to the ship for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left Nami there all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Robin's still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's a problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to part ways with the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll say goodbye to her here.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.20,0:11:26.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,514.4)\fad(730,0)\blur0.4\bord1.6\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(600,650,1.3\1a&H00&)}Galley-La Company \NHeadquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:11:22.20,0:11:26.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,514.4)\blur0.5\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(0,650,1.3,\alpha&H00&)}Galley-La Company \NHeadquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is seriously stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.66,0:11:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if he has it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet they keep sending me out\Nhere, over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish those people would put\Nthemselves in my shoes for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kalifa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be worn out, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already prepared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd expect nothing less\Nfrom you. Thank you. I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corgi is always so angry\Nwhen he leaves, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world does he\Ncome here to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those he represents want something I\Nhave, and they keep making various offers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be something of great\Nimportance, then, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe so, though I always\Ndeny knowing anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really are tiresome people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp's finally awake,\Nyou guys! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one less thing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin still isn't back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I ought to punch\Nyou for scaring us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it looks like you've taken\Nenough punches already, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking,\Ntaking those guys on alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just run off and\Nfight whoever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a good one coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wouldn't have happened\Nif I was strong like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew how important that money was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, stop. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're sorry, but you don't have\Nto get all touchy-feely on me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All our savings, all the trouble we went\Nthrough, what about the Mary? Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be out of bed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop your whining and\Nlisten to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:14:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is there a chance we might\Nget our money back after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't know for sure till\Nthat Franky guy shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if we can't get the rest back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we still have a hundred\Nmillion berries left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he lost twice that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly, is\NMary going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, can we get her repaired\Nwith the money that we have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we have all these\Nawesome shipwrights to work on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I know things are going\Nto get rough out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I want her to be\Nstronger than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't having them repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We decided to get a new ship instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that we probably should have asked\Nyou first, but we didn't have much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Going Mary has taken good care of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it looks like our journey\Nwith her has to end here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Ice Pops gave us this\Nawesome ship catalog to flip through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's all kinds of different\Nships we could pick from in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we decided to\Nshop for a used model?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could go bigger than the Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and still keep our budget\Nunder $100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the joke's gone on\Nlong enough, okay? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper doesn't know you're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how upset this is making him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Captain, you should know better\Nthan to treat your crew like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nami, back me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we don't\Nhave enough for the repairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I lost the\N200 million, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we can't afford\Nthe work on the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, a first-class shipyard\Nis going to cost a lot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop and listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Tell me!\NDon't try to sugarcoat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even care that you lost\Nall the money That's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you feel then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all this crap\Nabout buying a new ship of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it fighting isn't gonna help
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Don't see what I'm doing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one saying all\Nthis dumb stuff I know how
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you feel but you shouldn't\Nget so worked up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to Nami Usopp if you don't get\Nany rest you're not gonna get better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you just sit here when he's\Nmaking jokes about getting a new ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not joking about anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was a hard decision for me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I feel really sorry for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already window shopping for a new toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You trying to pick a fight with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want your damn pity, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you tell me it doesn't\Nmatter that I lost the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then why are you talking\Nabout buying a new ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just spit it out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't afford the repairs\Nbecause I screwed up, then tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't show me some stupid\Ncatalog and change the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mary can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me repeat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, the Mary\Ncan't be repaired anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what we do, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can't fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I wouldn't\Nsay something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.46,0:17:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship that we're riding\Non right now is broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of\Ntime before she sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, Luffy? That's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipwrights took a look\Nat the Mary themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said she wouldn't even\Nhold out until the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's settled, so that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of strangers\Ntell you to scrap your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ship and you don't even ask any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand these guys know what they're\Ntalking about, but this is just wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on the Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about all the adventures\Nwe've gone on together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about all the battles we've fought?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to abandon her for\Nanother ship without a second thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all we've been through, is that\Nhow little the Mary means to you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're upset, Usopp,\Nbut you need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not pecking down until we settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you know better than the shipwrights?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had someone on the crew\Nwho knew about this stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have asked\Nthem in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:18:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then forget them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need those guys\Ntelling us what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll repair the Mary\Nmyself, just like before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made it this far, so there's\Nno reason we can't go on that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll get started right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, we don't\Nhave enough lumber, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better go buy some at the shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a shipwright, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you're so hung up on\Neverything those stupid shipwrights say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they knew what she'd gone through,\Nthey wouldn't give up on the Mary so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want your money. Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mary's our ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's our job to take care of her\Nwithout someone else butting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let them take\Nthe Mary away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got fooled by a bunch of salesmen\Ntrying to pawn off a used boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy I know wouldn't cave in to some\Nsales bitch from a total stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd believe in the strength of the\NMary and the strength of his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here you are acting like you know\Neverything and ignoring your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that's the kind\Nof captain you turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not being fair, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy felt the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stand by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting a new ship,\Nwhether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road for the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're always trying\Nto think about the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but not everyone on\Nthis crew is like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the Mary as one\Nof our friends, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't abandon her when she's hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if she is a friend, that\Ndoesn't mean she's a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is to me, and she still\Nhas the strength to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't appreciate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because all you care about is\Ngetting a new ship to play with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being so selfish and\Nthink about your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, listen to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't act like you're the\Nonly one who's torn up about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that was true, then you\Nwouldn't be looking for a new ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't like the way\Nyour captain does things,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then why don't you go ahead and get on...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going way too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't watch it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to say something you\Ncan't take back, so calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize, because\Nthat's how you really feel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get rid of your dead weight and\Nmove on before they can slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going to throw away the\NMary, might as well throw me away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're pissed off, but\Ndon't say stupid crap like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:21:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about\Nthis for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't like it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are just too strong for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't keep up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean look what happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even trust me with your money
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No point in keeping me around if\Nall I do is cause you trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want weak people\Non your crew, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I still believe that you'll\Nbe King of the Pirates one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for me, I'm just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to make it this far
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even back when we first met\Nand I was gonna set off alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably just invited\Nme on your ship out of pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.12,0:22:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only reason I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:23:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sense traveling together\Nif we don't even have the same goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever I go, it's my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.08,0:23:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.40,0:23:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.44,0:23:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be like this! Come\Non! We can talk! Yeah! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:23:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uthab, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.90,0:24:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.94,0:24:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm sorry I can't\Nfollow you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.40,0:24:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry I was a\Npain till the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're the captain of this\Nship, so the Mary belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you to\Nfight me, Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.16,0:24:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.83,0:24:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At 10 o'clock tonight, I'll be back, so\Nyou better be ready for a fight, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.78,0:25:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop you from\Ndestroying your own ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if I win, I'm taking\Nthe Mary and leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, when we're done, the\Nlast bond between us will be broken.
